#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/control/control_frd_roundtrip.ipynb:10002
#: f8ad1ecbdfa94bfabb17d353a26e19c9
msgid "Compare Control Models with Measured Frequency Responses"
msgstr "制御モデルと実測周波数応答を比較する"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/control/control_frd_roundtrip.ipynb:10004
#: aad4ddc7b4374a26a8bcea9994a1a793
msgid ""
"Control loop design and vibration isolation modeling in gravitational-wave "
"detectors rely on state-space or transfer function models (often manipulated "
"via `python-control`), while detector diagnostic data are stored as "
"calibrated frequency series. Interoperating between continuous MIMO transfer "
"functions and discrete `FrequencySeries` requires maintaining input/output "
"channel pairings, physical units, and angular frequency contracts ($2\\pi$)."
msgstr ""
"重力波検出器における制御ループ設計と振動隔離モデリングは状態空間または伝達関数モデル（多くは `python-control` "
"で操作）に依存し、検出器診断データは校正済み周波数系列として保存されます。連続 MIMO 伝達関数と離散 `FrequencySeries` "
"の相互運用には、入出力チャンネルの対応付け、物理単位、および角周波数規約（$2\\pi$）の保持が必須となります。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/control/control_frd_roundtrip.ipynb:10006
#: 1bd5545913cb414b8a91f5db0b032984
msgid "**What you will achieve:**"
msgstr "**このチュートリアルで達成できること：**"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/control/control_frd_roundtrip.ipynb:10007
#: 2daac94cb0984c9c86908bdef424dba0
msgid ""
"Construct a normalized 2-input x 2-output MIMO transfer function model using "
"`control.TransferFunction`."
msgstr "`control.TransferFunction` を用いて、正規化された 2入力×2出力 MIMO 伝達関数モデルを構築します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/control/control_frd_roundtrip.ipynb:10008
#: 312117a71e124986b2f8b6b8f152f783
msgid ""
"Apply physical I/O scaling: inputs (force [N], torque [N m]) and outputs "
"(displacement [m], angle [rad])."
msgstr "物理的な入出力スケーリングを適用します：入力（力 [N]、トルク [N m]）および出力（変位 [m]、角度 [rad]）。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/control/control_frd_roundtrip.ipynb:10009
#: 8151412ed5064d9eba87ffcc4e7f3983
msgid ""
"Evaluate frequency response data (`control.frd`) across a log-spaced grid "
"from 0.5 Hz to 100 Hz."
msgstr "0.5 Hz〜100 Hz の対数グリッド上で周波数応答データ（`control.frd`）を評価します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/control/control_frd_roundtrip.ipynb:10010
#: e775b1cd44224c8ca8fd714248640fd8
msgid ""
"Convert between `control.frd` and GWexpy `FrequencySeries` verifying the "
"angular frequency ($2\\pi$) relationship."
msgstr "角周波数（$2\\pi$）関係を検証しながら、`control.frd` と GWexpy `FrequencySeries` の間を相互変換します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/control/control_frd_roundtrip.ipynb:10011
#: 300cd171d1d24fb9ac1edd2b1df185f5
msgid "Perform 4 SISO round-trip conversions and verify exact complex recovery."
msgstr "4組の SISO 往復変換を実行し、厳密な複素復元精度を検証します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/control/control_frd_roundtrip.ipynb:10012
#: 03e6eaf2a65b48efa7ab858e46848db8
msgid "Verify phase-wrapping handling, permutation tests, and zero-reference masking."
msgstr "位相ラッピングの処理、置換テスト、およびゼロ近傍マスクを検証します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/control/control_frd_roundtrip.ipynb:10014
#: 34c1a63ef52a4aa0947f0f58c23b94d6
msgid ""
"**Data type**: Simulated MIMO measurement and control transfer function model"
" (300 frequency bins)."
msgstr "**データ種別**: シミュレーションされた MIMO 測定および制御伝達関数モデル（300周波数ビン）。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/control/control_frd_roundtrip.ipynb:20002
#: 67199281447b4fc199baf2edccfdd734
msgid "Environment Setup"
msgstr "環境のセットアップ"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/control/control_frd_roundtrip.ipynb:40002
#: 0e01abb34adb4d1c9b345df4873ca562
msgid "Physical I/O Contract and Model Construction"
msgstr "物理I/O契約とモデル構築"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/control/control_frd_roundtrip.ipynb:60002
#: 35b4cdc9dfce43ed964b9052f73a2e6b
msgid "Interop: Angular Frequency Contract and SISO Round-Trip"
msgstr "相互運用：角周波数契約とSISO往復変換"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/control/control_frd_roundtrip.ipynb:80002
#: b7d1b71ad85344f19956c758ab5c09ef
msgid "Bode Comparison: Model vs Simulated Measurement"
msgstr "ボード線図比較：モデルと模擬測定"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/control/control_frd_roundtrip.ipynb:100002
#: fab1943f09b749f4993b6df6c5de0d34
msgid "Permutation, Phase Wrapping, and Zero Masking Checks"
msgstr "並べ替え・位相アンラップ・ゼロ近傍マスク検査"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/control/control_frd_roundtrip.ipynb:120002
